OL,3,GNEWSARacer suffered neck and chest
OL,4,Ainjuries - inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA racer killed in a crash during
OL,7,Fqualifying for the Manx Grand Prix
OL,8,Fsuffered neck and chest injuries, an
OL,9,Finquest has been told.
OL,11,FMauro Poncini, from Caslano in
OL,12,FSwitzerland, died in the crash at
OL,13,FCruickshanks in Ramsey on 18 August.
OL,15,FThe crash, which also involved another
OL,16,Frider, happened on the opening lap of
OL,17,Fthe evening qualifying session on the
OL,18,F37.7 mile (61km) Mountain Course at
OL,19,Fabout 18:50 BST.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
